cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the accompanying
  paper (preferred-citation).
type: software
title: "vfates: Same Rate, Different Fates"
abstract: >-
  Step-zero screen for when verifier errors transfer in RL with verifiable
  rewards. At matched false-positive and false-negative rates, resampled noise,
  prompt-specific errors, and errors carried by a shared behaviour lead to
  different held-out outcomes. Transfer precision, estimated before training,
  predicts which.
